{
  "title": "Ziyarat e Waaresa",
  "code": "012",
  "data": "Ziyarat of Imam Husain (a.s.)\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا وَارِثَ اٰدَمَ صَفْوَةِ اللهِ \nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA WAARESA AADAMA SAFWATIL LAAHE\nPeace be upon you, O inheritor of Adam, the chosen one of Allah. \nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا وَارِثَ نُوْحٍ نَبِىِّ اللهِ \nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA WAARESA NOOHIN NABIYYIL LAAHE\nPeace be upon you, O inheritor of Nuh, the Prophet of Allah. \nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا وَارِثَ اِبْرَاهِيْمَ خَلِيْلِ اللهِ \nASALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA WAARESA IBRAAHEEMA KHALEELIL LAAHE\nPeace be upon you, O inheritor of Ibrahim, the friend of Allah.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا وَارِثَ مُوْسٰى كَلِيْمِ اللهِ \nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA WAARESA MOOSAA KALEEMIL LAAHE\nPeace be upon you. O inheritor of Musa, the one who talked to Allah. \nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا وَارِثَ عِيْسٰى رُوْحِ اللهِ \nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA WAARESA E’ESAA ROOHIL LAAHE \nPeace be upon you, O inheritor of 'Isa, the spirit of Allah. \nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا وَارِثَ مُـحَمَّدٍ حَبِيْبِ اللهِ \nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA WAARESA MOHAMMADIN HABEEBIL LAAHE \nPeace be upon you, O inheritor of Muhammad, the beloved friend of Allah.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا وَارِثَ عَلِىٍّ اَمِيْرِ الْـمُؤْمِنِيْنَ وَلِىِّ اللهِ \nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA WAARESA AMEERIL MOOMINEENA WALIYYIL LAAHE \nPeace be upon you, O inheritor of Ali, the commander of the faithful and the friend of Allah. \nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَابْنَ مُحَمَّدٍۨ الْـمُصْطَفٰى \nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YABNA MOHAMMADENIL MUSTAFAA \nPeace be upon you, O son of Muhammad Mustafa.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَابْنَ عَلِىٍۨ الْـمُرْتَضٰى \nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YABNA A’LIYYENIL MURTAZAA \nPeace be upon you, O son of Ali Al-Murtaza.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا بْنَ فَاطِمَةَ الزَّهْرَآءِ \nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YABNA FAATEMATAZ ZAHRAAE \nPeace be upon you, O son of Fatema Zahra. \nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَابْنَ خَدِيْجَةَ الْكُبْرٰى \nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YABNA KHADEEJATAL KUBRAA \nPeace be upon you, O son of Khadijatul-kubra. \nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا ثَارَ اللهِ وَابْنَ ثَارِهٖ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA SAARAL LAAHE WABNA SAAREHI\nPeace be upon you, O vengeance of Allah, son of His vengeance,\nوَالْوِتْرَ الْـمَوْتُوْرَ \nWAL WITRAL MAWTOORA \nand the unavenged so far.\nاَشْهَدُ اَنَّكَ قَدْ اَقَمْتَ الصَّلوٰةَ\nASHHADO ANNAKA QAD AQAMTAS SALAATA \nI bear witness that verily you established the prayers \nوَ اٰتَيْتَ الزَّكٰوةَ \nWA AATAYTAZ ZAKAATA \nand gave the zakat (prescribed share) to the needy.\nوَ اَمَرْتَ بِالْـمَعْرُوْفِ\nWA AMARTA BIL MAA’ROOFE \nAnd commanded to do what is right and lawful \nوَ نَهَيْتَ عَنِ الْمُنْكَرِ \nWA NAHAYTA A’NIL MUNKARE \nand not to do that which is wrong and unlawful. \nوَ اَطَعْتَ اللهَ وَ رَسُوْلَهٗ\nWA ATAA’TAL LAAHA WA RASOOLAHU\nAnd obeyed Allah and His Messenger \nحَتّٰى اَتٰيكَ الْيَقِيْنُ \nHATTAA ATAAKAL YAQEENO \nuntil the inevitable came unto you. \nفَلَعَنَ اللهُ اُمَّةً قَتَلَتْكَ\nFALA’NAL LAAHO UMMATAN QATALATKA\nSo, Allah curse those who killed you \nوَ لَعَنَ اللهُ اُمَّةً ظَلَمَتْكَ \nWA LA’NAL LAAHO UMMATAN ZALAMATKA \nand Allah curse those who wronged you. \nوَ لَعَنَ اللهُ اُمَّةً سَمِعَتْ بِذٰلِكَ فَرَضِيَتْ بِهٖ \nWA LA’NAL LAAHO UMMATAN SAME-A’T BE-ZAALEKA FARAZEYAT BEHI \nAnd Allah curse those who heard the event and rested satisfied. \nيَا مَوْلاَىَ يَا اَبَا عَبْدِ اللهِ \nYAA MAWLAAYA YAA ABAA A’BDIL LAAHE \nO My Master, O Aba A’bdillah! \nاَشْهَدُ اَنَّكَ كُنْتَ نُوْرًا فِى الْاَصْلاَبِ الشَّامِـخَةِ \nASH-HADO ANNAKA KUNTA NOORAN FIL ASLAABISH SHAAMEKHATE \nI bear witness that verily you were a light in the sublime loins \nوَالْاَرْحَامِ الْـمُطَهَّرَةِ\nWAL ARHAAMIL MOTAHHARATE \nand purified wombs.\nلَمْ تُنَجِّسْكَ الْـجَاهِلِيَّةُ بِاَنْجَاسِهَا\nLAM TONAJJISKAL JAAHELIYYATO BE-ANJAASEHAA \nThe impurities of ignorance did not even touch you. \nوَلَمْ تُلْبِسْكَ مِنْ مُدْلَهِمَّاتِ ثِيَابِهَا \nWA LAM TULBISKA MIN MUDLAHIMMAATE SEYAABEHAA \nNor could its soiled and dirty bearing ever smear you. \nوَ اَشْهَدُ اَنَّكَ مِنْ دَعَآئِمِ الدِّيْنِ \nWA ASHHADO ANNAKA MIN DA-A’AA-EMID DEENE\nAnd I bear witness that, verily, you are the mainstay of the religion, \nوَ اَرْكَانِ الْـمُؤْمِنِيْنَ \nWA ARKAANIL MOOMINEENA \nand the supporter of the faithful ones. \nوَ اَشْهَدُ اَنَّكَ الْاِمَامُ الْبَرُّ التَّقِىُّ \nWA ASHHADO ANNAKAL EMAAMUL BARRUT TAQIYYUR\nAnd I bear witness that, verily, you are a pious, God-fearing, \nالرَّضِىُّ الزَّكِىُّ الْـهَادِى الْمَهْدِىُّ \nRAZIYYUZ ZAKIYYUL HAADIL MAHDIYYO \nfavorite, wise and rightly guided (Imam). \nوَ اَشْهَدُ اَنَّ الْاَئِمَّةَ مِنْ وُلْدِكَ \nWA ASHHADO ANNAL A-IMMATA MIN WULDEKA \nAnd I bear witness that the Imams, in your progeny, \nكَلِمَةُ التَّقْوٰى وَ اَعْلاَمُ الْهُدٰى \nKALEMATUT TAQWAA WA AA’-LAAMUL HODAA \nare the words of piety. And the signs of guidance \nوَالْعُرْوَةُ الْوُثْقٰى وَالْحُجَّةُ عَلٰى اَهْلِ الدُّنْيَا \nWAL U’RWATUL WUSQAA WAL HUJJATO A’LAA AHLID DUNYAA \nAnd the safe handle of Islam, and the decisive argument for the humankind. \nوَ اُشْهِدُ اللهَ وَ مَلٓائِكَتَهٗ\nWA USHHEDUL LAAHA WA MALAAA-EKATAHU \nAnd I call Allah to give witness, and also His Angels \nوَ اَنْبِيَآئَهٗ وَ رُسُلَهٗ \nand His Prophets and His Messenger. \nWA AMBEYAAA-AHU WA ROSOLAHU \nاَنِّىْ بِكُمْ مُؤْمِنٌ \nANNEE BEKUM MOMENUN \nThat, verily, I believe in (all of) you \nوَ بِاِيَابِكُمْ مُوْقِنٌ \nWA BE-EYAABEKUM MOOQENUN \nand that I am sure of your Return \nبِشَرَايِعِ دِيْنِىْ \nBESHARAAYE-E’ DEENEE \nJoined to the divine laws of my belief \nوَ خَوَاتِيْمِ عَمَلِىْ\nWA KHAWAATEEME A’MALEE \nand my accomplishments. \nوَ قَلْبِىْ لِقَلْبِكُمْ \nWA QALBEE LE-QALBEKUM \nAnd my heart is resigned to yours \nسِلْمٌ وَ اَمْرِىْ لِاَمْرِكُمْ مُتَّبِعٌ\nSILMUN WA AMREE LE-AMREKUM MUTTABE-U’N \nAnd my conduct is following the example of yours. \nصَلَوَاتُ اللهِ عَلَيْكُمْ وَ عَلٰى اَرْوَاحِكُمْ\nSALAWAATUL LAAHE A’LAYKUM WA A’LAA ARWAAHEKUM\nBlessings of Allah be on (all of) you And on your souls\nوَ عَلٰى اَجْسَادِكُمْ وَ عَلٰى اَجْسَامِكُمْ \nWA A’LAA AJSAADEKUM WA A’LAA AJSAAMEKUM \nand on your bodies and on your forms \nوَ عَلٰى شَاهِدِكُمْ وَ عَلٰى غَآئِبِكُمْ \nWA A’LAA SHAAHEDEKUM WA A’LAA GHAAEBEKUM \nAnd (when) you are in view and (when) you are out of sight \nوَ عَلٰى ظَاهِرِكُمْ وَ عَلٰى بَاطِنِكُمْ.\nWA A’LAA ZAAHEREKUM WA A’LAA BAATENEKUM.\nand on your apparent and on your concealed.\n\nZiyarat of Janab-e-Ali Akbar (a.s.)\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَابْنَ رَسُوْلِ اللهِ \nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YABNA RASOOLIL LAAHE \nPeace be upon you, O son of the Messenger of Allah. \nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَابْنَ نَبِىِّ اللهِ \nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YABNA NABIYYIL LAAHE \nPeace be upon you, O son of the Prophet of Allah. \nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَابْنَ اَمِيْرِ الْـمُؤْمِنِيْنَ \nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YABNA AMEERIL MOMENEENA \nPeace be upon you, O son of Ameer al-Mu’mineen (the commander of the believers). \nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَابْنَ الْـحُسَيْنِ الشَّهِيْدِ \nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YABNAL HUSAYNISH SHAHEEDE \nPeace be upon you, O son of al-Husayn the shaheed (martyr). \nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ اَيُّهَا الشَّهِيْدُ وَ ابْنُ الشَّهِيْدِ \nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA AYYOHASH SHAHEEDO \nPeace be upon you, O the martyr and the son of the martyred one. \nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ اَيُّهَا الْـمَظْلُوْمُ وَ ابْنُ الْـمَظْلُوْمِ \nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA AYYOHAL MAZLOOMO WABNUL MAZLOOME \nPeace be upon you, O the oppressed one and son of the oppressed one. \nلَعَنَ اللهُ اُمَّةً قَتَلَتْكَ\nLA-A’NAL LAAHO UMMATAN QATALATKA \nCurse of Allah be on those who killed you. \nوَ لَعَنَ اللهُ اُمَّةً ظَلَمَتْكَ \nWA LA-A’NAL LAAHO UMMATAN ZALAMATKA \nCurse of Allah be on those who persecuted you. \nوَ لَعَنَ اللهُ اُمَّةً سَمِعَتْ بِذٰلِكَ فَرَضِيَتِ بِهٖ\nWA LA-A’NAL LAAHO UMMATAN SAME-A’T BE-ZAALEKA FARAZEYAT BEHI.\nAnd curse of Allah be on those who heard this even but rested satisfied.\n\nZiyarat of Shohadaa-e-Karbala (a.s.)\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكُمْ يَا اَوْلِيَآءَ اللهِ وَ اَحِبَّائَهٗ \nASSALAAMO A’LAYKUM YAA AWLEYAAA-AL LAAHE WA AHIB-BAAA-AHU \nPeace be upon all of you, O the saints and dears of Allah. \nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكُمْ يَا اَصْفِيَاءَ اللهِ اَوِدَّائَهٗ \nASSALAAMO A’LAYKUM YAA ASFEYAAA-AL LAAHE WA AWIDDAAA-AHU \nPeace be upon all of you, O the adorers of Allah and the sincere ones attached to Him. \nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكُمْ يَا اَنْصَارَ دِيْنِ اللهِ \nASSALAAMO A’LAYKUM YAA ANSAARA DEENIL LAAHE \nPeace be upon all of you, O the helpers of Allah’s religion. \nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكُمْ يَا اَنْصَارَ رَسُوْلِ اللهِ \nASSALAAMO A’LAYKUM YAA ANSAARA RASOOLIL LAAHE \nPeace be upon all of you, O the helpers of the Messenger of Allah. \nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكُمْ يَا اَنْصَارَ اَمِيْرِ الْـمُؤْمِنِيْنَ \nASSALAAMO A’LAYKUM YAA ANSAARA AMEERIL MOMENEENA \nPeace be upon all of you, O the helpers of Ameer al-Mu’mineen. \nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكُمْ يَا اَنْصَارَ فَاطِمَةَ سَيِّدَةِ نِسَآءِ الْعٰلَمِيْنَ \nASSALAAMO A’LAYKUM YAA ANSAARA FAATEMATA SAYYEDATE NESAAA-IL A’ALAMEENA \nPeace be upon all of you, O the helpers of Fatimah the leader of the women of this universes. \nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكُمْ يَا اَنْصَارَ اَبِىْ مُـحَمَّدٍۨ الْـحَسَنِ ابْنِ عَلِىٍّۨ الزَّكِىِّ النَّاصِحِ \nASSALAAMO A’LAYKUM YAA ANSAARA ABEE MOHAMMADENIL HASANIBNE A’LIYYENIL WALIYYIN NAASEHE \nPeace be upon all of you, O the helpers of Abu Muhammad al-Hasan ibn Ali The sincere, pure and faithful saint. \nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكُمْ يَا اَنْصَارَ اَبِىْ عَبْدِ اللهِ \nASSALAAMO A’LAYKUM YAA ANSAARA ABEE A’BDIL LAAHE \nPeace be upon all of you, O the helpers of Abu Abdullah. \nبِاَبِىْ اَنْتُمْ وَ اُمِّىْ طِبْتُمْ\nBE-ABEE ANTUM WA UMME TIBTUM\nMy father and mother be sacrificed for you Verily, you were pure; \nوَ طَابَتِ الْاَرْضُ الَّتِىْ فِيْهَا دُفِنْتُمْ \nWA TAABATIL ARZUL LATEE FEEHAA DOFINTUM \ntherefore, the land wherein you are buried has been purified. \nوَ فُزْتُمْ فَوْزًا عَظِيْمًا\nWA FUZTUM FAWZAN A’ZEEMAA\nYou also attained your end and won great fortune. \nفَيَالَيْتَنِىْ كُنْتُ مَعَكُمْ فَاَفُوْزَ مَعَكُمْ.\nFA-YAALAYTANEE KUNTO MA-A’KUM FA-AFOOZA MA-A’KUM.\nWould that we were with you so that we could also share the accomplishment with you.\n\nZiyarat of Hazrat Abbas (a.s.)\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَابْنَ اَمِيْرِ الْمُؤْمِنِيْنَ \nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YABNA AMEERIL MOMENEENA \nPeace be upon you, O son of Commander of the Faithful; \nالسَّلاَمُ عَلَيْكَ اَيُّهَا الْعَبْدُ الصَّالِحُ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA AYYOHAL A’BDUS SAALEHUL\nPeace be upon you, O virtuous servant, \nالْمُطِيْعُ لِلّٰهِ وَ لِرَسُوْلِهٖ \nMO-TEE-O’ LILLAAHE WA LE-RASOOLEHI \nobedient to Allah and His Messenger; \nاَشْهَدُ اَنَّكَ قَدْ جَاهَدْتَ\nASH-HADO ANNAKA QAD JAA-HADTA \nI bear witness that you did truly fight the Holy War, \nوَ نَصَحْتَ وَ صَبَرْتَ \nWA NASAHTA WA SABARTA\nand you did help the cause of Faith; and you did patiently endure \nحَتّٰى اَتٰيكَ الْيَقِيْنُ\nHATTAA ATAAKAL YAQEENO\nUntil the certainty (of death) came upon thee.\nلَعَنَ اللهُ الظَّالِمِيْنَ لَكُمْ \nLA-A’NAL LAAHUZ ZAALEMEENA LAKUM\nMay Allah deprive those who wronged you of His Mercy, \nمِنَ الْاَوَّلِيْنَ وَ الْاٰخِرِيْنَ\nMENAL AWWALEENA WAL-AAKHEREENA\nwhether they may have been of the first or the last (i.e., all of them); \nوَ اَلْحَقَهُمْ بِدَرْكِ الْجَحِيْم.\nWA ALHAQAHUM BE-DARAKIL JAHEEM.\nand may He consign them to the nethermost regions of Hell."
}
